    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "ɲɛ",
      "rationale": "Heburukan ma 'ɲɛ' daɲɛ si sɛbɛn 'ɲɛ fɛ' kɔnɔ; לפני ɲɛfɛ-kɔkanna bɛ Bamanankan la 'ɲɛ' de wajibiya."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Sabu i dusukun ye wɔgɔrɔya, i y'i jɔ ji Elohim ɲɛ fɛ ni i ye ⟨את⟩ a kumaw mɛn o yɔrɔ in kan ani a ɔmɔgɔw kan, i y'i jɔ ji n ɲɛ fɛ, i ye ⟨את⟩ i jaw bɛgɛn, i ye kansi na n ɲɛ fɛ, anka ne mɛnla, Yawe ko.",
